<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-Apartment Investment raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Apartment Investment raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- PaineWebber raised its rating of Apartment Investment and Management Co to attractive from its prior rating of neutral.</p>
<p>-- The stock rose 5/8 to 22-1/4, a new 52-week high.</p>
</text>
